WEBVTT

00:26.420 --> 00:26.840
<b>m 82 222 l 159 118 327 136 364 231 332 300 146 325</b>

00:26.420 --> 00:26.840
<b>Medaka!</b>

00:27.090 --> 00:27.840
<b>m 255 63 l 290 32 404 38 432 83 404 116 286 114</b>

00:27.090 --> 00:27.840
<b>Why are you
always so mean
to Mona-chan?</b>

00:27.090 --> 00:27.840
<b>m 92 258 l 114 236 171 228 225 239 246 266 236 300 214 317 140 318 88 292</b>

00:27.090 --> 00:27.840
<b>Do your tenets
not tell you to be
nice to people?</b>

01:23.270 --> 01:29.980
<b>Medaka Kuroiwa
Is Impervious to My Charms</b>

01:23.270 --> 01:29.980
<b>Medaka Kuroiwa
Is Impervious to My Charms</b>

01:30.360 --> 01:33.230
I mean, it's my bestie's first love!

01:30.770 --> 01:34.940
<b>Episode 10: Theme Park with Him</b>

01:33.930 --> 01:35.610
First love...?

01:36.300 --> 01:40.320
You're seriously in love with Kuroiwa-kun.

01:41.240 --> 01:42.240
Wha?

01:43.290 --> 01:47.440
Me? In love with Medaka?

01:52.760 --> 01:57.130
Quit deciding things for me.

01:59.850 --> 02:02.670
I was so close to dozing off 
in that last class.

02:02.670 --> 02:05.760
Did you manage to take down 
all the notes? Wanna check mine?

02:06.750 --> 02:09.120
Thanks! I knew I could count on you!

02:11.420 --> 02:17.320
Time for the very first Help Mona Realize 
Her Feelings for Kuroiwa-kun meeting!

02:19.060 --> 02:22.950
Hint 1: you can't eat 
when you're lookin' at him.

02:22.950 --> 02:25.700
I can too. I just had lunch earlier.

02:25.700 --> 02:28.300
Hint 2: you wanna see him 
so bad, you tremble...

02:28.300 --> 02:30.210
Do not. I see him five days a week, anyway.

02:31.790 --> 02:35.300
Can we just agree to disagree? This is a pain.

02:35.720 --> 02:38.350
Rude! I'm just tryin' to help!

02:38.350 --> 02:40.400
But you've got the wrong idea!

02:40.400 --> 02:42.940
Then just brush it off.

02:42.940 --> 02:46.440
But you can't, 'cause you know 
there's somethin' to it, right?

02:46.440 --> 02:47.810
Listen to me!

02:48.450 --> 02:50.020
Hey, it's Mona-senpai.

02:50.350 --> 02:52.890
Oh, morning, Asahi.

02:52.890 --> 02:54.510
It's lunchtime, though.

02:54.510 --> 02:57.480
I-I know, but I haven't seen you today.

02:57.760 --> 02:58.860
Okay?

02:58.860 --> 03:02.100
Friends of yours? They're first-years, right?

03:02.100 --> 03:04.120
Yeah, well...

03:04.420 --> 03:07.230
What a pair o' cuties!

03:07.230 --> 03:12.520
I'm Tomo Namba. Skip the formalities 
and just call me Tomo-chan!

03:12.520 --> 03:14.000
And you are?

03:14.750 --> 03:16.200
Excuse me.

03:16.200 --> 03:19.010
I dislike getting chummy 
with people I've just met.

03:19.510 --> 03:20.760
Please stop.

03:25.760 --> 03:28.520
It's <i>adorable</i> how you're so prickly!

03:28.520 --> 03:31.880
L-Let go of me! What is <i>with</i> this girl?

03:31.880 --> 03:36.500
Yeah, Tomo doesn't know 
how to take no for an answer.

03:37.360 --> 03:39.990
Staaaare

03:39.240 --> 03:42.160
Uh... You're Asahi's friend?

03:42.160 --> 03:42.990
Yep!

03:43.330 --> 03:46.590
Nice to meet you. I'm Minami Shirahama.

03:46.990 --> 03:48.990
Y-Yeah.

03:49.670 --> 03:53.210
<i>Wh-Why do I feel like a research 
subject or something?</i>

03:53.210 --> 03:56.750
<i>She's hot 24/7. Good luck, Asahi. 
You're gonna need it.</i>

03:56.750 --> 04:01.380
R-Right! Asahi, didn't you wanna talk 
to Mona-senpai about something?

04:02.010 --> 04:03.380
Me?

04:03.660 --> 04:05.890
Unhand me!

04:05.890 --> 04:06.890
Come with me for a sec.

04:06.890 --> 04:08.890
What's going on?

04:08.890 --> 04:11.580
You go back to class, Minami.

04:11.580 --> 04:12.640
'Kay.

04:15.520 --> 04:20.500
Who <i>is</i> that handsy girl? 
Is she really your childhood friend?

04:20.500 --> 04:23.150
Heh... So, what's up?

04:23.590 --> 04:26.570
I know it's kinda weird to self-report this,

04:26.910 --> 04:31.300
but I'm doing it anyway 'cause 
I don't wanna sneak around.

04:35.250 --> 04:38.250
Huh? Where's all this coming from?

04:39.910 --> 04:41.210
I...

04:47.260 --> 04:50.140
I gave Kuroiwa-senpai a kiss.

04:54.940 --> 04:56.180
<i>Huh?</i>

04:57.720 --> 05:01.790
<i>What?! She gave Medaka a k... ki...</i>

05:04.700 --> 05:06.980
Anyway, now you know.

05:12.170 --> 05:14.200
Did you hear all that?

05:14.200 --> 05:16.640
H-Hear all what?

05:16.640 --> 05:18.390
Not that I really care.

05:22.750 --> 05:26.300
<i>What a surprise. Didn't know Kuroiwa-kun 
was so popular with the girls.</i>

05:26.300 --> 05:31.560
<i>Still, "gave him a kiss" and "kissed him" 
are two very different things.</i>

05:32.430 --> 05:36.710
<i>A kiss? Really?</i>

05:39.900 --> 05:43.790
<i>And she's not just lyin' or makin' it up?</i>

05:45.350 --> 05:46.640
<i>That's weird.</i>

05:46.640 --> 05:50.950
<i>Why am I gettin' all worked up over this?</i>

05:55.830 --> 05:57.240
<i>See?</i>

05:57.240 --> 05:59.960
<i>She really does like Kuroiwa-kun.</i>

05:59.960 --> 06:03.590
<i>This'll give her the kick up the backside 
she needs to realize that.</i>

06:04.220 --> 06:05.230
Mona.

06:05.230 --> 06:07.340
Huh? Did you hear that?

06:07.340 --> 06:09.860
Let's throw a welcome party for me.

06:09.860 --> 06:14.350
Invite Kuroiwa-kun and those girls 
just now, and let's all go hang out!

06:14.350 --> 06:15.610
Wha?

06:20.680 --> 06:25.110
No way Tomo ain't plottin' something.

06:25.110 --> 06:28.320
I got bigger things to worry about, girl.

06:28.820 --> 06:32.320
I gave Kuroiwa-senpai a kiss.

06:32.720 --> 06:35.550
The heck? When'd she make all that progress?

06:35.550 --> 06:38.330
She got to know him after I did, right?

06:41.370 --> 06:43.460
It's like they're datin'...

06:44.870 --> 06:48.010
I-Is Medaka Asahi's man now?

06:48.770 --> 06:55.010
After resistin' my charms all this while? 
How could you, Medaka?!

06:56.470 --> 06:57.630
But wait.

06:57.630 --> 07:01.900
She didn't exactly say they were goin' out.

07:02.520 --> 07:06.840
I'm pretty sure she said she "gave him a kiss."

07:06.840 --> 07:09.900
Not that they "kissed."

07:09.900 --> 07:15.410
M-Maybe she just forced a kiss on him?

07:16.530 --> 07:21.050
Th-The heck? I was jumpin' at shadows!

07:22.260 --> 07:25.610
Settle down. I mean...

07:25.610 --> 07:28.560
I'm just tryin' to charm him here.

07:28.560 --> 07:31.010
It ain't like I wanna be his girlfriend.

07:31.940 --> 07:35.320
My goal is to make him succumb to me.

07:35.320 --> 07:38.210
So go ahead and kiss him. 
Heck, get really close to him.

07:38.210 --> 07:40.810
I got a buncha fans 
who have girlfriends already.

07:41.190 --> 07:46.020
Long as he fawns over me like everyone else, 
I don't care 'bout the details.

07:50.090 --> 07:53.990
It won't bother me if they start datin'...

08:06.130 --> 08:11.690
<i>Why's this annoyin' me so much?! 
I don't get it!</i>

08:14.760 --> 08:18.260
<b>Marimo Station</b>

08:20.770 --> 08:23.610
Morning! A-And nice to meet you.

08:23.610 --> 08:26.340
Likewise. And good morning.

08:27.020 --> 08:30.830
Who are we missing? Medaka and Namba-san?

08:30.830 --> 08:32.490
And Mona-chan.

08:35.390 --> 08:37.520
Morning, Mona-chan...

08:37.520 --> 08:39.580
Huh? Why do you seem so beat up?

08:39.580 --> 08:42.400
I'm not. I'm totally fine.

08:42.400 --> 08:45.140
<i>I couldn't sleep a wink.</i>

08:45.140 --> 08:47.460
<i>I'm so sleepy, I could die.</i>

08:48.270 --> 08:53.880
<i>I'm just gonna spend today makin' sure 
Asahi doesn't get up to any more shenanigans.</i>

08:54.290 --> 08:57.390
<i>Mona-senpai seems kind of subdued today.</i>

08:58.010 --> 09:00.800
<i>I didn't tell her it was 
on the cheek and not the lips...</i>

09:00.800 --> 09:02.640
<i>But that much is allowed, right?</i>

09:02.640 --> 09:04.460
<i>All's fair in love and war.</i>

09:04.460 --> 09:08.670
<i>Kuroiwa-senpai's coming too. 
I gotta make this count.</i>

09:09.390 --> 09:10.650
Mornin'!

09:10.650 --> 09:12.150
Oh, there they are.

09:12.630 --> 09:14.670
Y'all got here early.

09:15.070 --> 09:16.410
Morning.

09:18.660 --> 09:21.030
<i>And here come the two causin' all my issues.</i>

09:21.450 --> 09:23.300
Why are you with Namba-san?

09:23.300 --> 09:26.610
Tread carefully. Your next words 
may decide your fate.

09:26.610 --> 09:28.920
Uh, we just ran into each other on the way.

09:33.460 --> 09:36.470
<i>Wait, where am I even lookin'?!</i>

09:36.760 --> 09:39.230
G-Good morning, Senpai.

09:39.230 --> 09:40.850
Hey, morning.

09:40.850 --> 09:43.040
<i>Crap! I let her make the first move!</i>

09:43.560 --> 09:45.520
So, about today...

09:45.520 --> 09:47.840
M-Morning, Kuroiwa-kun.

09:47.840 --> 09:48.850
Morning.

09:54.360 --> 09:56.650
<i>Hang in there, Asahi...</i>

09:58.030 --> 10:02.870
<i>Feels like her rival's gonna win 
by the time Mona realizes.</i>

10:03.300 --> 10:07.680
<i>It's your first love, girl. 
You can't let it end like that.</i>

10:07.680 --> 10:08.900
<i>Fine.</i>

10:09.290 --> 10:11.640
<i>I got your back.</i>

10:11.640 --> 10:14.670
All right, lemme tell you 
where we're goin' today.

10:14.960 --> 10:16.130
Where to?

10:16.130 --> 10:17.630
Well...

10:17.630 --> 10:19.970
Gotta go with the tried-and-tested,

10:19.970 --> 10:24.140
the birthplace of many a romance: 
the theme park!

10:27.600 --> 10:29.980
<b>Medaka Kuroiwa
Is Impervious to My Charms</b>

10:32.610 --> 10:34.980
<b>Medaka Kuroiwa
Is Impervious to My Charms</b>

10:35.560 --> 10:37.990
Whoo, this is hype!

10:38.380 --> 10:40.750
I haven't been here in ages.

10:40.750 --> 10:42.240
Me neither.

10:43.490 --> 10:47.310
S-So this is a theme park in the big city...

10:47.310 --> 10:49.610
So many attractions.

10:49.610 --> 10:52.960
Man, this really brings out my inner child!

10:52.960 --> 10:56.410
M-Mona-chan, let's ride something together.

10:56.410 --> 10:57.460
S-Sure.

10:57.820 --> 11:02.890
<i>Gah, I'm at Dreamyland, 
but I'm not excited at all.</i>

11:02.890 --> 11:06.430
<i>I gotta keep my eye on Asahi. 
She's in attack mode.</i>

11:06.430 --> 11:10.440
<i>And I gotta be wary of Tomo. 
She's in scheming mode.</i>

11:10.440 --> 11:14.060
<i>And for some reason, 
this girl's in staring mode.</i>

11:14.060 --> 11:16.420
<i>These two guys are the same as ever,</i>

11:16.420 --> 11:18.570
<i>Haruno-san's presence is soothing,</i>

11:18.570 --> 11:20.570
<i>and Medaka's...</i>

11:30.090 --> 11:32.370
Wh-What's wrong, Mona-chan?

11:32.370 --> 11:34.180
N-Nothing, really.

11:34.180 --> 11:35.090
If you say so.

11:39.040 --> 11:40.910
What do we start with?

11:40.910 --> 11:42.680
Let me think.

11:42.680 --> 11:46.520
I have a suggestion. 
I wanna ride a roller coaster.

11:46.520 --> 11:48.570
Sounds good.

11:48.570 --> 11:50.730
Let's start with the star attraction.

11:52.480 --> 11:55.240
I'm starting to get excited.

11:55.240 --> 11:57.270
You sure do love your thrill rides.

11:57.270 --> 11:59.280
How do you wanna split up?

12:04.850 --> 12:07.320
U-Um, Kuroiwa-senpai.

12:08.540 --> 12:13.450
I get scared easily. C-Could you sit with me?

12:13.920 --> 12:17.430
I'll be fine if you're there with me.

12:19.130 --> 12:20.340
<i>Th...</i>

12:20.340 --> 12:22.840
<i>That's their game?</i>

12:23.140 --> 12:27.270
H-Hey, wait! I'm scared too...

12:27.890 --> 12:33.050
<i>Wait a sec. I don't want Asahi 
sitting with Medaka,</i>

12:33.050 --> 12:35.950
<i>but if I do this, I'll have to sit with him.</i>

12:35.950 --> 12:39.400
<i>I don't know if I'm ready for that right now...</i>

12:39.830 --> 12:43.100
You can sit with me, Asahi-chan.

12:43.610 --> 12:45.790
You're riding with me, Kobayakawa-senpai.

12:45.790 --> 12:47.730
C'mon, let's line up.

12:47.730 --> 12:51.900
Gosh, me and you? If you insist.

12:51.900 --> 12:54.680
Y-You can sit with me, Mona-chan.

12:56.270 --> 12:58.670
Let's go, Haruno-san.

12:58.670 --> 12:59.630
Huh?

13:00.000 --> 13:03.260
I've always wanted a chance to chat with you.

13:03.260 --> 13:04.880
Wh-What? Um...

13:04.880 --> 13:08.160
Which leaves me and Mona?

13:09.000 --> 13:12.180
We should line up, Kuroiwa-senpai.

13:12.180 --> 13:17.440
<i>Wh-What now? They're gonna sit together...</i>

13:21.940 --> 13:25.920
Crap, my knees are bucklin'.

13:25.920 --> 13:29.690
I wanted to give it the ol' college try, 
but it ain't gonna work.

13:29.690 --> 13:31.200
What's wrong?

13:31.200 --> 13:32.410
You see...

13:32.410 --> 13:35.330
I'm really scared of rides with drops.

13:35.330 --> 13:38.830
But I don't wanna leave Mona all alone.

13:39.370 --> 13:42.710
In that case, Kuroiwa-kun, 
could ya ride twice?

13:44.030 --> 13:45.760
H-Hey, Tomo.

13:45.760 --> 13:50.920
We can't make poor Mona ride 
all by herself, so please?

13:50.920 --> 13:52.610
S-Sure, I guess.

13:52.610 --> 13:56.600
A-Are you really sure? You want to go twice?!

13:56.600 --> 13:57.890
I don't mind.

13:58.300 --> 14:01.900
He's so nice! Good for you, Mona!

14:05.540 --> 14:06.950
Let's just go!

14:08.630 --> 14:10.650
See ya later.

14:11.560 --> 14:14.260
I hope you appreciate my nice assist.

14:14.260 --> 14:16.330
No idea what you're on about.

14:17.000 --> 14:18.490
<i>Safety bar coming down.</i>

14:19.560 --> 14:21.840
You're in the first row, Medaka-kun.

14:21.840 --> 14:26.330
Sh-Shonan-san said it'd be less scary.

14:26.330 --> 14:28.530
Will you be okay, Shonan-san?

14:28.530 --> 14:32.470
Y-Yeah. I feel better when I can see 
where we're going.

14:36.700 --> 14:38.210
<i>And we're away.</i>

14:38.210 --> 14:41.610
<i>Actually, I'm not great with these either.</i>

14:42.290 --> 14:44.610
U-Um, Senpai...

14:46.860 --> 14:50.860
Could you hold my hand to make me feel better?

14:52.270 --> 14:56.200
M-My heart feels like it's going 
to explode otherwise.

14:56.200 --> 14:57.830
R-Right.

14:58.260 --> 15:00.960
<i>Void... Void... I am void!</i>

15:01.260 --> 15:03.840
<i>We're so high up! So high, so high, so high!</i>

15:03.840 --> 15:06.560
<i>Her hand's so tiny and soft! I can't be void!</i>

15:06.560 --> 15:08.110
<i>I went and clenched her hand!</i>

15:08.110 --> 15:11.730
<i>I can't tell if it's her or the ride 
that's got my heart racing!</i>

15:12.140 --> 15:14.470
Sorry, Senpai.

15:15.220 --> 15:18.930
There's something I need 
to apologize to you for.

15:19.310 --> 15:20.070
Huh?

15:21.310 --> 15:24.190
I was lying when I said I get scared easily.

15:29.650 --> 15:33.400
C'mon, it's more fun when 
you put your hands up!

15:38.690 --> 15:40.290
They're havin' fun.

15:40.290 --> 15:42.540
And it's your turn next.

15:44.920 --> 15:47.060
Quit fidgetin' and just wait.

15:47.060 --> 15:49.300
Wh-Who's fidgetin'?!

15:49.730 --> 15:51.170
That was fun.

15:51.170 --> 15:53.190
There, they're back.

15:53.800 --> 15:55.960
We're back, Mona-chan!

15:55.960 --> 15:57.810
D-Did you have fun?

15:58.080 --> 16:01.310
My heart's still racing like crazy.

16:01.310 --> 16:03.770
<i>What about Medaka and Asahi?</i>

16:06.560 --> 16:08.280
How'd it go, Asahi?

16:10.090 --> 16:11.030
Eh.

16:12.790 --> 16:14.750
Come on, tell me!

16:14.750 --> 16:15.520
Nope.

16:15.520 --> 16:17.410
<i>Wh-What's with the satisfied smile?</i>

16:17.740 --> 16:20.410
<i>What'd she manage to pull off this time?!</i>

16:20.410 --> 16:22.160
I saw that, Medaka-kun.

16:22.160 --> 16:24.320
You held hands with Shonan-san, didn't you?

16:25.420 --> 16:26.850
Uh, that's because...

16:26.850 --> 16:30.370
Say what? Someone's enjoying himself.

16:30.370 --> 16:33.430
No! She said she was scared...

16:33.430 --> 16:36.400
But wait, she actually wasn't?

16:37.200 --> 16:38.440
What're you even saying?

16:39.310 --> 16:43.320
<i>Asahi totally went to hold hands.</i>

16:43.320 --> 16:45.690
<i>There ain't no brakes on her train!</i>

16:46.020 --> 16:49.290
'Kay, have fun, Mona and Kuroiwa-kun.

16:53.850 --> 16:56.100
Off we go!

16:56.100 --> 16:59.330
<i>How did Asahi manage to hold Medaka's hand?</i>

16:59.620 --> 17:01.870
<i>But wait, doin' the same thing won't help.</i>

17:01.870 --> 17:05.330
H-Hey, did you have fun on the first go?

17:05.690 --> 17:07.630
Huh? Yeah...

17:07.630 --> 17:12.040
<i>S-So he did enjoy it. I shouldn't have asked.</i>

17:12.040 --> 17:13.880
<i>She's as pretty as ever!</i>

17:13.880 --> 17:16.380
<i>This is bad, bad news!</i>

17:16.380 --> 17:19.470
<i>First a kiss, and now they hold hands?</i>

17:19.470 --> 17:22.060
<i>Asahi really is in attack mode.</i>

17:22.360 --> 17:24.140
S-Say...

17:24.560 --> 17:28.900
You haven't fallen for Asahi, have you?

17:29.940 --> 17:32.670
<i>Hey! What's with that reaction?!</i>

17:32.670 --> 17:34.320
<i>C-Could it be...</i>

17:34.320 --> 17:36.950
<i>Could this be the famed love gossip?</i>

17:36.950 --> 17:39.210
I-I have not.

17:40.450 --> 17:42.990
<i>What am I breathin' a sigh of relief for?!</i>

17:42.990 --> 17:46.790
<i>Tokyo's amazing. A boy and a girl 
can casually talk about this stuff here.</i>

17:47.210 --> 17:52.330
<i>I've been here long enough. I need to be 
able to hold these conversations, too.</i>

17:52.710 --> 17:55.040
Wh-What about you, Mona-chan?

17:56.040 --> 17:59.430
Is... Is there anyone you like?

17:59.760 --> 18:01.050
Wha?

18:01.490 --> 18:02.720
<i>Nailed it!</i>

18:03.470 --> 18:05.350
<i>Anyone I like?</i>

18:06.030 --> 18:10.060
You're seriously in love with Kuroiwa-kun.

18:13.570 --> 18:16.070
<i>N-No comment?!</i>

18:24.260 --> 18:26.080
Oh, welcome back.

18:26.080 --> 18:28.080
How was it, Mona-chan?

18:30.080 --> 18:32.630
Mona-chan? What's the matter?

18:32.930 --> 18:34.250
How'd it go?

18:34.620 --> 18:37.630
<i>I ticked her off somehow!</i>

18:37.950 --> 18:40.890
<i>Must be because I got carried away 
and tried to have a Tokyo convo.</i>

18:40.890 --> 18:41.890
What's wrong?

18:41.890 --> 18:43.800
You screwed up again?

18:44.430 --> 18:46.930
How was it, Mona?

18:46.930 --> 18:50.150
Namba-san... Something seems off.

18:51.980 --> 18:53.340
Hey.

18:54.910 --> 18:56.040
What?

18:58.290 --> 18:59.720
<i>Okay, something's up.</i>

18:59.720 --> 19:01.990
Sorry! I was spacing out.

19:01.990 --> 19:05.370
<i>Looks like something might've happened.</i>

19:05.370 --> 19:07.870
<i>I should check with Kuroiwa-senpai.</i>

19:07.870 --> 19:08.630
Hey!

19:10.620 --> 19:13.380
It's Buggy Bun! Cute!

19:13.380 --> 19:14.600
Buggy Bun?

19:14.600 --> 19:18.360
The theme park's mascot! We gotta get a pic!

19:18.360 --> 19:20.380
I can take one for you.

19:20.700 --> 19:25.330
Asahi, I know you like your kigus! 
Come take one with me.

19:25.330 --> 19:27.640
F-Fine, if I have to.

19:29.580 --> 19:32.520
Please get a bunch of different angles.

19:32.520 --> 19:36.080
Here we go. Say cheese.

19:38.380 --> 19:42.090
Thank you! Oh, let me return the favor.

19:42.090 --> 19:43.700
Th-Thanks.

19:44.100 --> 19:45.380
Should we get one?

19:45.380 --> 19:46.490
Sounds good.

19:46.890 --> 19:48.240
Here I go.

19:51.550 --> 19:53.300
You're not joinin', Kuroiwa-kun?

19:53.300 --> 19:54.250
Nah.

19:57.350 --> 19:58.920
In that case...

19:58.920 --> 20:01.900
Could ya go buy some snacks?

20:01.900 --> 20:03.430
You and Mona both.

20:03.900 --> 20:06.580
They seem occupied with the mascot.

20:06.580 --> 20:09.540
Please, for me. 
This is my welcome party, y'know?

20:09.540 --> 20:11.290
Wh-What are you doing?

20:11.680 --> 20:13.660
Off ya go.

20:13.660 --> 20:14.690
<i>Sheesh.</i>

20:17.170 --> 20:19.400
<i>Good luck, Mona.</i>

20:22.000 --> 20:25.570
<i>Ugh... I couldn't do anythin' yet again.</i>

20:26.180 --> 20:29.830
Is... Is there anyone you like?

20:30.300 --> 20:33.660
<i>Never expected that question to come from him!</i>

20:34.110 --> 20:35.210
That's the place.

20:35.210 --> 20:40.250
Come one, come all. 
We have a special promotion ongoing!

20:40.250 --> 20:42.340
A special promotion? Let's go!

20:42.340 --> 20:44.150
We'll take some.

20:44.900 --> 20:46.890
You two are in luck.

20:47.180 --> 20:51.790
We've got some limited freebies for couples.

20:51.790 --> 20:53.640
Couples...

20:53.640 --> 20:56.110
Are you two together?

20:56.110 --> 20:58.150
U-Uh...

20:58.450 --> 21:02.590
L-Let's just go with it for now, okay?

21:02.590 --> 21:04.820
Huh? O-Okay...

21:06.660 --> 21:08.330
Yes, we are.

21:08.330 --> 21:09.910
Awesome.

21:09.910 --> 21:12.910
Now you just need to prove it.

21:13.210 --> 21:14.910
Prove it?

21:14.910 --> 21:17.500
Kiss for us, here and now.

21:21.330 --> 21:23.130
<i>K-Kiss?</i>

21:24.920 --> 21:26.130
<i>I can't!</i>

21:28.390 --> 21:31.680
<i>N-No, chickenin' out won't help.</i>

21:31.680 --> 21:35.390
<i>Anything Asahi can do, I can do better!</i>

21:35.750 --> 21:37.940
<i>Y-Yeah, just do it!</i>

21:37.940 --> 21:40.220
<i>It's just a kiss. Who cares?</i>

21:41.350 --> 21:42.710
Kuroiwa-kun...

21:51.180 --> 21:53.560
Close your eyes.

23:44.980 --> 23:49.990
<b>Episode 11





Alone with Him</b>

23:44.980 --> 23:49.990
<b>Medaka Kuroiwa
Is Impervious to My Charms</b>

23:46.680 --> 23:49.990
Next time: "Alone with Him."
